<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78445" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραμύ̄θ-ιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>address, exhortation</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				773e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				880a
			</span></i> (both pl.); <i>encouragement</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ μὴ φοβεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					272b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>assuagement, abatement of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					130
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρσῶν</span>
			<i>of</i> the fires of love, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				23.7
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπὶς κινδύνῳ π. οὖσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.103
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραμύθια ποιήσασθαι τῆς ὁδοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					632e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				704d
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς γὰρ πλουσίοις πολλὰ π.
				φασιν εἶναι</span> many <i>consolations</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				329e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				240d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				19
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύπης παραμύθιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					298.7
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Teos</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.768a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραμύθια πλησμονῆς</span>
			<i>stimulants</i> of a sated appetite, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				115b
			</span></i>.</div>
